  m_text: A Quick Connect/Disconnect Coupling (QCDC) enables rapid attachment or
    separation of two shafts while maintaining reliable torque transfer. Hubs align
    and lock through a mechanical linkage or collar. In the locked state, motion
    is shared; when released, components separate easily, allowing fast maintenance,
    modular replacement, and safe operation in mechanical systems.
